---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHead from '../components/PageHead.astro';
// ⚠️ PLATZHALTER — Publikations-Gate G4: Die finale Datenschutzerklärung hängt vom
// Warteliste-Dienst-Entscheid (E-C132) und vom Hosting ab. Der Marker unten blockiert
// den Deploy (tools/deploy-gate.mjs), solange er existiert.
---
<Base title="Privacy" description="Privacy policy for fixedr.com." bare>
  <PageHead eyebrow="Legal">Privacy</PageHead>
  <article class="post">
  {/* HTML-Kommentare überleben den Astro-Build NICHT — der Marker muss als Attribut in dist/ ankommen */}
  <div class="callout" data-blocker="WPAC26-PLACEHOLDER-DO-NOT-PUBLISH">
    <p><strong>Placeholder.</strong> The final privacy policy is added before this site goes
    public. What is already decided and will not change:</p>
  </div>
  <ul>
    {/* E-C161: „keine Fremd-Tracker" statt „trackt dich nicht" — die eigene
        Funnel-Messung (Warteliste, Quellen-Link) darf den Satz nicht widerlegen. */}
    <li>This site sets no cookies, carries no third-party trackers and no advertising
      pixels. Your data is never sold or shared.</li>
    <li>All assets (fonts, images, styles) are served from this domain — nothing is loaded
      from third parties.</li>
    {/* FXR-1938: die Anmeldung speichert die Herkunftsseite JE Adresse — der fruehere Satz
        „a count, not a profile, not tied to an identity" stimmte damit nicht mehr. */}
    <li>The waitlist uses a confirmed signup (double opt-in): you are on the list only after
      you click the link in the confirmation e-mail. The link is valid for 48 hours;
      unconfirmed signups are deleted within a day after it expires.</li>
    <li>For each signup we store your e-mail address, the language, the page you signed up
      on, the time of signup, confirmation and unsubscribe, and the version of the consent
      text you agreed to. No name, no IP address.</li>
    <li>Every e-mail carries a one-click unsubscribe link. After you unsubscribe we keep only
      the record that you agreed and unsubscribed (address, times, consent version), so that
      we can show it and do not write to you again.</li>
  </ul>

  {/* FXR-1938: Abschnitte, die die Anmeldung braucht und die NICHT erfunden werden duerfen.
      Jeder ist als Platzhalter markiert; der Marker oben haelt den Deploy weiter auf. */}
  <div class="callout" data-blocker="WPAC26-PLACEHOLDER-DO-NOT-PUBLISH">
    <p><strong>Placeholder — sections still to be written before publication:</strong></p>
    <ul>
      <li>[PLACEHOLDER] Controller: name and postal address (from the imprint), contact e-mail for privacy requests.</li>
      <li>[PLACEHOLDER] Purpose and legal basis of the waitlist e-mails: consent, Art. 6(1)(a) GDPR; withdrawal at any time without affecting earlier processing.</li>
      <li>[PLACEHOLDER] Legal basis for keeping the proof of consent and unsubscribe after withdrawal, and for how long.</li>
      <li>[PLACEHOLDER] Recipients and processors: the host of the signup server and the provider that sends the e-mails (names, locations, data processing agreements, transfers outside the EU if any).</li>
      <li>[PLACEHOLDER] Server log files of the website and the signup server: what is logged, for how long.</li>
      <li>[PLACEHOLDER] Your rights (access, rectification, erasure, restriction, portability, objection) and how to use them; right to lodge a complaint with a supervisory authority.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  </article>
</Base>
